Concrete code patterns for implementing the BFF (Backend for Frontend) architecture, showing how a shared endpoint serves different clients with different response shapes.
## Web BFF (Node.js/Express)
Aggregates from multiple services and enriches the response for web consumers:
```javascript
app.get('/api/products', async (req, res) => {
  const { category, page } = req.params;
  const products = await productService.getByCategory(category, page);
  const reviews = await reviewService.getReviews(products.map(p => p.id));
  const wishlist = await userService.getWishlist(req.user.id);
  const recommendations = await aiService.getRecommendations(req.user.id);
  res.json({
    products: products.map(p => ({ ...p, reviews: reviews[p.id], isInWishlist: wishlist.includes(p.id) })),
    recommendations,
    seoMeta: { title: `${category} products` },
    pagination: { page, total: 450, perPage: 20 }
  });
});
```
## Mobile BFF (Node.js/Express)
Serves the same endpoint with Redis caching and minimal response shape:
```javascript
app.get('/api/products', async (req, res) => {
  const { category, page } = req.params;
  const products = await redis.get(`products:${category}:${page}`);
  if (!products) {
    const freshProducts = await productService.getByCategory(category, page);
    await redis.set(`products:${category}:${page}`, freshProducts, 'EX', 600);
  }
  res.json({
    products: products.map(p => ({ id: p.id, name: p.name, price: p.price })),
    pagination: { page, hasMore: page < 10 }
  });
});
```
## API Gateway middleware (NGINX config)
```javascript
location /api/ {
    auth_request /validate_token;
    limit_req zone=web burst=100 nodelay;
    limit_req zone=mobile burst=50 nodelay;
    gzip on;
    gzip_types application/json text/plain;
    access_log /var/log/nginx/api.log request_id=$request_id;
    if ($http_user_agent ~* "mobile|android|iphone") {
        proxy_pass http://bff_mobile;
    }
    proxy_pass http://bff_web;
}
```
The gateway routes mobile user-agents to the mobile BFF and all others to the web BFF, while enforcing auth, rate limits, and compression uniformly.
